### Q2 — Observation independence

**[VERIFIED EXPERIMENTAL]** This experiment proves that observationally identical single-channel streams cannot reveal which of its two constructed latent causes generated them.

**[UNRESOLVED]** I did not find an implementation-level inventory establishing which actual Nexus observation sources are causally independent versus sharing calibration, clocks, preprocessing, ontology, substrate, models, or provenance machinery.

