**[CANONICAL]** The HVD master architecture explicitly prohibits an ephemeral HVD from self-promoting merely because its own contents claim importance or permanence. Candidate salience, HTCE selection, continued TMS realization, material isolation/distribution, and durable persistence are deliberately separate stages.

